        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Felix is at an impasse in his family life and his job. His wife Bianca wants a separation, his children are moving away from him and his hair is falling out. When he also loses his job, Felix finds himself on the edge of the abyss. That's when a mysterious stranger offers him three wishes.",
          "runtime": 96,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "The Life of Wishes"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "DE",
        "iso_639_1": "de",
        "name": "Deutsch",
        "english_name": "German",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Felix steckt mit seinem Familienleben und seinem Job in einer Sackgasse. Seine Frau Bianca will die Trennung, seine Kinder entfernen sich von ihm und ihm fallen die Haare aus. Als er auch noch seinen Job verliert, steht Felix am Rande des Abgrunds. Da bietet ihm ein geheimnisvoller Fremder drei Wünsche an.",
          "runtime": 95,
          "tagline": "Eine fantastische Geschichte über die Liebe.",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "菲利克斯正处在人生的僵局中，无论是家庭还是工作。他的妻子比安卡想要分开，他的孩子们逐渐远离他，他的头发也在不断脱落。当他连工作也失去时，菲利克斯发现自己已经站在深渊的边缘。就在这时，一个神秘的陌生人向他提出了三个愿望。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "三愿浮生"
        }
      }
